# Third-party primary sources retrieved for research staging.
#
# Deliberately NOT committed. The repository is CC BY 4.0 for OUR curated data; the
# publishers' articles carry their own terms and redistributing them here would both
# misapply that license and misstate provenance.
#
# What IS committed is everything needed to reproduce the retrieval:
#   ../logs/acquisition_manifest.json  — source URL, retrieval date, HTTP code, bytes, SHA-256
#   ../trial_verification_2026-10-02.csv — the facts extracted, with exact locus per row
#
# Re-fetch with the URLs in the manifest and check the SHA-256 to confirm you have the
# same bytes this extraction was made from.
*
!.gitignore
